  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "あいてへの　いらだちを　ぶつけて　こうげき。\nそのターンに　のうりょくを　さげられていると\nわざの　いりょくが　２ばいに　なる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "상대에 대한 울분이 담긴 공격을 한다.\n그 턴에 능력이 떨어져 있으면\n기술의 위력이 2배가 된다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "將惱怒砸向對手進行攻擊。\n如果此回合已被降低能力，\n招式威力就會變成２倍。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Le lanceur frappe l’ennemi avec toute sa rancune.\nSi les stats du lanceur ont diminué pendant ce tour,\nla puissance de cette attaque est doublée.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Der Anwender entlädt seinen Frust in einem Angriff.\nDie Stärke der Attacke wird verdoppelt, wenn seine\nStatuswerte in dieser Runde gesenkt wurden.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ataca al rival presa de la rabia. Si el usuario ha sufrido\nuna reducción de características en ese turno, la\npotencia del movimiento se duplica.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Chi la usa attacca il bersaglio con tutta la propria ira.\nSe ha subito riduzioni delle statistiche durante quel\nturno, la potenza della mossa raddoppia.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "The user lashes out to vent its frustration toward\nthe target. If the user’s stats were lowered during this\nturn, the power of this move is doubled.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "相手への　いらだちを　ぶつけて　攻撃。\nそのターンに　能力を　さげられていると\n技の　威力が　２倍に　なる。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "攻击对手以发泄对其感到的恼怒情绪。\n如果在该回合内自身能力遭到降低，\n招式的威力会变成２倍。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
